### ─── STEP 1: Login ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Run this first. Copy the token from the response and paste it into the
### @token variable below (or replace the Bearer values in each request).

POST http://localhost:1538/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Paste the token from the response here:
